# Chat widget API URL pattern

## Required pattern

- Runtime API origin comes from `data-api-url` / `window.BokitoConfig` / script-derived origin (never hardcode a customer Xano host in source).
- All paths under the livechat Xano API group (`api:livechat/...`) must be built with `livechatHttpUrl` from `apps/chat-widget/src/api/livechat-url.ts`, using segment constants from `apps/chat-widget/src/api/livechat.routes.ts` where applicable.
- Other Xano groups (for example host `auth/me`) use `xanoApiGroupUrl` with an explicit group slug defined next to the route in `livechat.routes.ts` (or a named constant re-exported from there).

## Do not

- Do not concatenate `` `${apiUrl}/api:livechat/` `` (or similar) outside `apps/chat-widget/src/api/`.
- Do not add new ad-hoc `api:Something` path strings in UI or stream modules; add a named segment or helper under `src/api/` first.
